</section>
<section class="cu-card"><div class="cu-card-head"><div><h2>Stored supplies</h2><p>Each row represents a batch. Transfers use the earliest-expiring available batch first.</p></div><span class="cu-badge"><?=$data['total']?> batches</span></div>
